{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Turning Manor! Your job is simple:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Count the glitches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the correct door</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this won't be as easy as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.poster.avif?t=1758825720\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.webm?t=1758825720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.mp4?t=1758825720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Demo\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you complete half of the floors of the first area of Turning Manor once. It\u2019s a small peek into what the full game has to offer and takes 15-20 minutes to complete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique areas</strong>. Each with distinct layouts, dangers and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approachable yet challenging</strong>. Beginner friendly as perfect accuracy is not needed to progress, yet challenging for experts as glitches get more difficult and a good grade requires good accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery to unravel</strong>. Find and collect items for clues to uncover more about the Manor's inhabitants. Discover the answer to question: what is going on at Turning Manor? </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No part of this game knowingly uses AI generated content or images. Though many industry standard programs incorporate AI into their workflow and we can\u2019t guarantee externally created assets are not AI generated, Sabbatical Games tries to minimize the impact on our final content by using a combination of hand crafted, photo scanned and creative commons assets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040700?t=1758825720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040700?t=1758825720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/0f706635889286e55cdcc9aafec632f5ab6906df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758825720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/0f706635889286e55cdcc9aafec632f5ab6906df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758825720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Turning Manor! Your job is simple:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Count the glitches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the correct door</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this won't be as easy as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.poster.avif?t=1758825720\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.webm?t=1758825720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040700/extras/e9dc2e8bbedbd67286dcbbb0427dbecc.mp4?t=1758825720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Demo\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you complete half of the floors of the first area of Turning Manor once. It\u2019s a small peek into what the full game has to offer and takes 15-20 minutes to complete.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique areas</strong>. Each with distinct layouts, dangers and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approachable yet challenging</strong>. Beginner friendly as perfect accuracy is not needed to progress, yet challenging for experts as glitches get more difficult and a good grade requires good accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery to unravel</strong>. Find and collect items for clues to uncover more about the Manor's inhabitants. Discover the answer to question: what is going on at Turning Manor? </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No part of this game knowingly uses AI generated content or images. Though many industry standard programs incorporate AI into their workflow and we can\u2019t guarantee externally created assets are not AI generated, Sabbatical Games tries to minimize the impact on our final content by using a combination of hand crafted, photo scanned and creative commons assets.</p>","developers":["Sabbatical Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3855530","name":"Turning Manor"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":